 610+ 6065                  ; --- RENDERING STANDARD WILLY ---
 611+ 6065                  ; 1. Determina sprite per la testa (sinistra o destra)
 612+ 6065 3A EF F7         ld   a, (direction)
 613+ 6068 FE 01            cp   1                 ; Sinistra?
 614+ 606A 20 06            jr   nz, .right_head
